===Head to the bottom of The Shackling Prison to investigate the status of the Yaoqing messenger{{subst:void|<!--202210501-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=The Shackling Prison|In the Shackling Prison, unidentified machines and prison breakers wreak chaos with impunity. Their goal is to rescue the borisin Warhead. Meanwhile, the Yaoqing messenger's fate is unknown. At the behest of Hanya, you all have no choice but to delve deeper into the Shackling Prison to confirm if the convict is still behind bars...}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:At the same time, (Trailblazer), Dan Heng, and Hanya realize that the situation in the prison is out of control...
:'''Wraith Warden:''' Madam Hanya, the wardens in all areas are regrouping. Those ingenium enemies are wandering around and causing heavy casualties.
:'''Wraith Warden:''' And to make things worse, those iron wolves broke open the cages and let the criminals out! We've called for backup, but it seems like all communication is jammed.
:'''Hanya:''' Let's preserve our strength and first take down the isolated prisoners. By decree of the Ten Lords, all prison breakers and intruders shall be apprehended, dead or alive.
:'''Aurumaton Spectral Envoy:''' Just a short time ago, the Nether Key mechanism was activated. It was probably Madam Xueyi and the Yaoqing messengers, heading to the bottom of the prison. Given the situation, I'm afraid that area is exactly where our enemies are targeting.
:'''Hanya:''' We mustn't let that vile beast escape from its cage!
:'''Aurumaton Spectral Envoy:''' We've gathered all the prison guards who can still fight, and we'll split up and secure each floor.
:'''Hanya:''' Go!
:'''Dan Heng:''' Those intruders are quite bold. They must have been planning this for quite a while.
:'''Hanya:''' Indeed, but borisin tend to favor direct and aggressive approaches. Crafting careful and precise plans like this... is simply not their style.
:'''Hanya:''' Let's focus on the current situation right now. Please help me!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Looks like the testimony will have to wait, huh?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Like I said, wherever we go, we always end up in trouble.
::Like I said, wherever we go, we always end up in trouble.
:'''Dan Heng:''' What's the fastest way to the bottom of this prison, Miss Hanya? If we don't get there quickly, we'll soon be outnumbered by all the enemies inside.
:'''Hanya:''' We'll have to bend the rules. Please follow me.
:{{tx}}

:{{DIcon|Изучение}} Investigate
:Large pieces of metal scraps are strewn all over the floor. You can't put your finger on it, but you're certain that this thing is still alive. Bionic tissues are relentlessly regenerating beneath their exoskeleton.

:{{DIcon|Изучение}} Investigate
:The intimidating countenance has no response whatsoever. The gate doesn't budge.
{{Dialogue End}}

