===Speak to the Yaoqing messenger{{subst:void|<!--202210510-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:The man seems to materialize from the shadowy corners of the prison, as if he could vanish into thin air at any moment.
:The "fugitive wearing a dark cloak," spoken of by Hanya, now stands before you. His face is devoid of any expression, cold and indifferent, yet... inexplicably, you could decipher this expressionless facade as if it whispered, "You're finally here."
:'''Moze:''' The prison management on the Luofu is truly concerning...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You already said that a moment ago.
::'''Moze:''' So what if I repeat it? It's the truth after all. The prison management on the Luofu is truly concerning...
::You look better when you're silent.
::'''Moze:''' ...
::'''Moze:''' Is that so?
::Hey, you're the Yaoqing messenger who fled!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You look better when you're silent.
::'''Moze:''' ...
::'''Moze:''' Is that so?
::Hey, you're the Yaoqing messenger who fled!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hey, you're the Yaoqing messenger who fled!
:'''Moze:''' I prefer to be called "the Yaoqing messenger who strategically retreated."
:'''Moze:''' At least two different groups of intruders infiltrated here &mdash; the {{Rubi|wolf cubs|borisin}} and these Mara-Struck Soldiers.
:'''Moze:''' Their hiding technique... it's pretty similar to the Wind Mantle technique used by the Vidyadhara serving Caelorum Venti on the Yaoqing. What do you think?
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...
:'''Moze:''' Well, never mind if you don't have any clues. Now is not the time to exchange assassination techniques.
:'''Moze:''' I'm Moze. {{Rubi|My friend|Jiaoqiu}} fell into the clutches of {{Rubi|that wolf|Hoolay}}. I was planning to escape and report back as quickly as possible, but now it seems...
:'''Moze:''' The prison on the Luofu is a real maze, I must admit.
:'''Hanya:''' Thank you for your help, Mr. Moze. We'll do our best to ensure your friend's safety.
:'''Moze:''' No, you can do nothing for him now, and you shouldn't be focusing on his safety at the moment.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're so heartless!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But isn't he your friend?
:'''Dan Heng:''' Your friend is in Hoolay's clutches, and you're just going to leave him behind?
:'''Moze:''' Look, I'm the Yaoqing General's guard, not his. I've seen how that giant wolf fights, and there is no way. Trying to save my friend will only get us killed.
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...
:'''Moze:''' I don't know how you think, but I won't throw my life away for a lost cause.
:'''Moze:''' Listen up, I've been tracking these fugitives, and I know their next move. They're planning to seal off the entire prison to keep the outside world in the dark.
:'''Moze:''' The worst-case scenario, we are all killed by that giant wolf, and the Shackling Prison is sealed off. No one will know about us or about their escape until it's too late.
:'''Moze:''' And the best-case scenario...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We kick all those bad guys' butts!
::With an indifferent gaze, he sized you up and down. Somehow, you deciphered his expressionless face as saying, "This person's lost their mind, how pitiful."
::We trap them inside this prison.
::'''Moze:''' No, we won't be able to. We're one step behind them.
::Both we and the intruders get trapped inside this prison.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We trap them inside this prison.
::'''Moze:''' No, we won't be able to. We're one step behind them.
::Both we and the intruders get trapped inside this prison.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Both we and the intruders get trapped inside this prison.
:'''Moze:''' Ah, looks like we've got some clever minds here after all.
:'''Moze:''' The best-case scenario would be, we seal the gates and trap the enemy inside with us. We can't let that monstrous wolf escape.
:'''Moze:''' Hopefully, someone will eventually notice that something is off and come to help. As for whether we'll still be alive by then, it's not something we should think about.
:'''Dan Heng:''' You sure have a way of comforting people, Mr. Moze.
:'''Moze:''' As a person of the Yaoqing, I've always searched for something meaningful to give my life to.
:'''Dan Heng:''' I have to make it out alive. My companions are waiting for me.
:'''Hanya:''' As a netherworld dweller, I've already died once.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Well, then I'll give it my all.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Yeah, we won't give up, not until the very last moment.
::I want to make it out alive, too.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Don't worry. Even if we end up dying here, I won't let it happen to you first.
::'''Hanya:''' Well, you're just as good at comforting people as Mr. Moze.
::Are we really out of options?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to make it out alive, too.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Don't worry. Even if we end up dying here, I won't let it happen to you first.
::'''Hanya:''' Well, you're just as good at comforting people as Mr. Moze.
::Are we really out of options?
