:{{DIcon|Изучение}} Xueyi
:'''(Trailblazer):''' Xueyi... is here.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Miss Xueyi bravely sacrificed herself... My condolences, Miss Hanya.
:'''Hanya:''' Condolences? Well, that's unnecessary.
:'''Hanya:''' You misunderstand. Thanks to the Ten Lords' blessing, my sister turned into an ingenium centuries ago. Dying and returning as just a soul to the Hall of Karma's document office has become a routine for her.
:'''Hanya:''' While I'm not keen on seeing her throw away her body like it's some replaceable part, but...
:'''Hanya:''' By the way, have you seen bodies that might be the Yaoqing messengers? One of them is a foxian wearing exquisite clothes, and the other wears a dark cloak, like a fugitive.
:'''Dan Heng:''' ...No, I haven't found any foxian bodies, only borisin ones.
:'''Hanya:''' So, the intruders and Hoolay are holding the Yaoqing messengers hostage.
:'''Hanya:''' This is the worst situation. With hostages in their grasp, the prison guards can't do anything about the prisoners. If anything happens to the messengers, the relationship between the Yaoqing and the Luofu... could be irreversibly damaged.
:'''Hanya:''' We must rescue the messengers, get out of here, and spread the news. We mustn't give up as long as there's a glimmer of hope!
:'''Dan Heng:''' What have you found, Miss Hanya?
:'''Broken Cycrane:''' Han... Han...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What the heck!?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} A cyber specter!
:'''Broken Cycrane:''' Re... Reconstru...
:{{tx}}

{{Dialogue End}}

